s":["Kilom\u00e9ter"],"Miles":["M\u00e9rf\u00f6ld"],"Distance list":["T\u00e1vols\u00e1glista"],"Comma-separated positive numbers, for example 5,10,25,50,100.":["Vessz\u0151vel elv\u00e1lasztott pozit\u00edv sz\u00e1mok, p\u00e9ld\u00e1ul: 5,10,25,50,100."],"User Geolocation filters visitors by their location on the frontend.":["A User Geolocation a helysz\u00edn\u00fck alapj\u00e1n sz\u0171ri a l\u00e1togat\u00f3kat a webhely fel\u00fclet\u00e9n."]}}}